{"version":1,"content":"<p>犯罪新片《打劫銀行是咁的》（How to Rob a Bank）將傳統奪寶片公式融合社交媒體，講述新世代一班銀行劫匪，一邊打劫一邊拍片，之後上載網站做「打劫界KOL」，教導大眾如何打劫，挑戰資本主義，牽動一場社會革命！</p><p>美國導演David L</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:28:39.961521+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:21:57.278667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:21:57.278667+00:00","content_hash":"65ecab21983e20f828d6d55ef083604a820651088df4b7b009098c1291001ca2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}